{"id":"circunstancia","lemma":"circunstancia","pos":"noun","rank":1699,"glosses":["circumstance"],"ipa":"/θiɾkunsˈtanθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"circunstancias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/ca/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-circunstancia.wav","examples":[{"text":"Las circunstancias han cambiado.","en":"Circumstances have changed.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"changed"}]},{"text":"Bajo ninguna circunstancia debes abandonar la habitación.","en":"Under no circumstances must you leave the room.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/703507","words":[{"g":"short"},{"g":"nobody","l":"ninguno"},null,{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to abandon, to leave"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"room"}]},{"text":"Él se adaptó a las circunstancias.","en":"He adapted himself to circumstances.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"oneself"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Bajo estas circunstancias, no puedo aceptar la oferta.","en":"Under these circumstances, I cannot accept the offer.","words":[{"g":"short"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to accept"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"offer"}]},{"text":"Circunstancias desfavorables me impidieron viajar.","en":"Unfavorable circumstances prevented me from traveling.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589697","words":[null,null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to impede, hinder","l":"impedir"},{"g":"to travel, journey"}]}]}